The Antechamber Next Door~
   Zone 49's only room. It exists so that this corpus has two zones,
because a great deal of what the yaml writer decides -- which file a
mobile, an object or a shop is written into -- has exactly one possible
answer when there is only one zone to choose from.
   The shopkeeper next door keeps a shop numbered in zone 50's range.
